<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Additional performance metrics for LLY (healthcare sector) comparing LLM-based approaches using ATLAS in volatile, declining market conditions. Ann. SR = Annualized Sharpe Ratio, ROIC = Return on Invested Capital, P/T = Profit per Trade. <span id="A4.T6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> values indicate the best per model.</figcaption>
</figure>
