<section id="A6.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.1.2 </span>Central Agent - Follow-up Decision Prompt</h4>

<div id="A6.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Follow-up Decision Prompt regulates the agent’s iterative reasoning process after initialization. It integrates updated analytical inputs and portfolio states to determine whether position adjustments are justified. This prompt ensures adaptive responsiveness to evolving market conditions while maintaining alignment with the initial strategic configuration.
The prompt is provided below.</p>
</div>
