<section id="A6.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.2.2 </span>Market Analyst - Follow-up Prompt</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Follow-up Prompt manages iterative updates after the initial analysis. It enables the Market Analyst to incorporate newly available data, refresh indicator readings, and re-evaluate market conditions. This prompt maintains analytical consistency with the initial framework while highlighting only the most relevant developments for ongoing trading decisions.
The prompt is provided below.</p>
</div>
